        "id": "tassadar",
        "name": "Tassadar"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "To get the most value out of Bestow Hope, you should pick Auriel together with a Hero who can consistently deal damage from the distance (such as Valla) without relying too much on skillshots.\n\nDetainment Strike benefits from impassable terrain, making Auriel better when paired with Heroes that can push enemy Heroes on it (like Diablo with Shadow Charge) or create it out of nowhere (for example Nazeebo with Zombie Wall).\n\nAs she can fight for long periods of time without having Mana issues, Auriel likes to be in team with Heroes who can take care of multiple lanes at the same time by double soaking (like Yrel) while the rest of her team puts a lot of pressure on a single lane.\n\nSince she heals using Energy instead of Mana, Auriel is one of the best Healers to pair with Cho'Gall, another Hero without Mana. Furthermore, using Bestow Hope on them will convert both Cho's and Gall's damage into Energy."
  },
  "counters": {
    "heroes": [
      {
        "id": "anubarak",
        "name": "Anub'arak"
      },
      {
        "id": "chen",
