      "name": "Detainment Strike Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Auriel's Detainment Strike Build empowers your healing output, crowd control, and damage. Due to how Detainment Strike works, this Build works best when fighting near impassable terrain.\n\nLevel 13 is flexible. You can pick Blinding Flash to Blind melee Heroes, Converging Force as a secondary interrupt for stationary channels, or Piercing Lash to for additional crowd control on grouped enemy Heroes.\n\nSince it increases your maximum Energy, Reservoir of Hope at Level 16 not only makes Ray of Heaven heal more but also deal more damage to enemy Heroes via Searing Light at Level 1. So, when hitting enemy Heroes with it, you will gain Energy.",
